event: response.content_part.done
data: {"sequence_number":539,"type":"response.content_part.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_bc705a7b-fb9c-9f0b-8af7-6375c401cdfc","output_index":9,"part":{"type":"output_text","text":"**xAI (now operating as SpaceXAI following its acquisition by SpaceX) has been highly active with product releases and expansions in August 2026.** The standout recent announcements include the launch of their new flagship model Grok 4.6 and the Grok Bot AI teammate product, plus broader availability and integrations.[[1]](https://x.ai/news)\n\nOn August 12, they released **Grok 4.6**, a significant upgrade over Grok 4.5 at the same price. It focuses on long-running agents, coding, knowledge work, and more ambitious interactive/visual tasks. It stays on complex multi-step jobs (research, codebases, building apps), matches GPT-5.6 Sol on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index (score of 61), and shows gains across benchmarks like CursorBench and Terminal-Bench. It\u2019s available in Cursor, Grok Build, the API, and partners like OpenRouter, with pricing at $2 per million input tokens and $6 per million output tokens (a faster variant costs twice as much). They offered 2x usage in Cursor and Grok Build for the first week.[[2]](https://x.ai/news/grok-4-6)\n\nJust a day earlier (August 11), they introduced **Grok Bot** in beta: always-on AI teammates/agents with their own cloud computer that work inside your existing tools, apps, and inboxes 24/7. You message them like colleagues to hand off real work (sales, operations, bug fixes, etc.), and they only check in for approvals. It launched for SuperGrok Heavy, Cursor Ultra, and certain Cursor Teams subscribers.[[3]](https://x.ai/news/introducing-grok-bot)\n\nThe most recent updates (as of August 21) expand access: **Grok Bot is now included with SuperGrok Plus, Cursor Pro+, and all Cursor Teams plans**. They also added Grok 4.6 to Amazon Bedrock (with 500K context) and the Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform, plus Grok Build availability on web and mobile. Other nearby announcements include Grok 4.6 in GitHub Copilot.[[4]](https://x.ai/news/grok-bot-more-plans)\n\nThese build on earlier 2026 moves like the $20B Series E funding, the SpaceX merger, and rapid model/iteration cadence (Grok 4.5 launched in July). For the full official recap, check x.ai/news.","logprobs":[],"annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://x.ai/news","start_index":319,"end_index":343,"title":"1"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://x.ai/news/grok-4-6","start_index":1032,"end_index":1065,"title":"2"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://x.ai/news/introducing-grok-bot","start_index":1474,"end_index":1519,"title":"3"},{"type":"url_citation","url":"https://x.ai/news/grok-bot-more-plans","start_index":1884,"end_index":1928,"title":"4"}]}}

